# Architecture

`AGENTS.md` is the source of truth for this repo — read it before substantive changes.

Quick guardrails (details and examples in `AGENTS.md`):

- Layers: `api` → league modules / `soccer` → `db` → host use cases → `commands`
- Dispatch via `League` enum methods; `Season::default_for_guild()` / `League::for_guild` in gameplay commands
- Poller uses live seasons (`polling_enabled`), not command focus
